Frequency once per day; 
Requirements The spitting sawfly is adjacent to a creature with the wood trait or to a coiled conifer; 
Effect The sawfly feasts upon the targeted creature or the coiled conifer's sap, regaining 5d6 Hit Points. A targeted creature must attempt a DC 29 Fortitude save or become drained 1 (drained 2 on a critical failure).
